## User Interaction

### AskQuestion

Collects structured multiple-choice answers from the user.

| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `title` | string | No | Optional title for the form |
| `questions` | object[] | Yes | Array of question definitions |

Each question:
| Field | Type | Required | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `id` | string | Yes | Unique identifier |
| `prompt` | string | Yes | Question text |
| `options` | object[] | Yes | Answer options (min 2) |
| `allow_multiple` | boolean | No | Default false; allow multiple selections |

**When to use**: Presenting discrete options to the user, when blocked on a decision, collecting structured preferences.

### SwitchMode

Switches the interaction mode.

| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `target_mode_id` | string | Yes | "plan" or "agent" |
| `explanation` | string | No | Why the mode switch is requested |

**When to use**: 
- **Plan mode**: Complex tasks with meaningful trade-offs, architectural decisions, unclear requirements
- **Agent mode**: Clear understanding of what to implement, ready to execute

