## MCP Integration

### ListMcpResources

Lists all available resources from an MCP server.

| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `server` | string | Yes | MCP server identifier |

### FetchMcpResource

Fetches the content of a specific MCP resource.

| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `server` | string | Yes | MCP server identifier |
| `uri` | string | Yes | Resource URI |
| `downloadPath` | string | No | Optional local path to save resource |
| `requestSmartModeApproval` | boolean | No | Request approval if blocked |
| `smartModeBlockReason` | string | No | Block reason from auto-review |

### CallMcpTool

Calls a tool on an MCP server.

| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `server` | string | Yes | MCP server identifier |
| `toolName` | string | Yes | Tool name to invoke |
| `arguments` | object | Yes | Tool-specific parameters |
| `requestSmartModeApproval` | boolean | No | Request approval if blocked |
| `smartModeBlockReason` | string | No | Block reason from auto-review |

