## Web

### WebSearch

Searches the web for real-time information.

| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `search_term` | string | Yes | Search query |
| `explanation` | string | No | One-sentence explanation of why this search is needed |

### WebFetch

Fetches content from a specified URL.

| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `url` | string | Yes | URL to fetch |
| `requestSmartModeApproval` | boolean | No | Request approval if blocked |
| `smartModeBlockReason` | string | No | Block reason from auto-review |

